Project Overview
This project uses Apache Spark, Databricks and Delta Lake to analyse DMart retail transaction data.

Task 1: Data ingestion, cleaning, transformation and Delta Lake optimisation.
Task 2: MapReduce-style processing, data partitioning and performance evaluation.
Task 3: Random Forest classification and regression, ARIMA and SARIMA forecasting.

Dataset Access
Download the original dataset from the Kaggle URL above. Extract the CSV file and upload it to a Databricks Unity Catalog volume to reproduce the analysis.
